    {
      "id": "45a34f91-5f61-438a-8984-cfc9826c3f84",
      "name": "Sticky Note bfd0ab85",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Content Engine · Render & Preview\nCalled by **Plan Post** and **Owner Replies** with a `post_id`.\n\n1. Loads the post and its client settings.\n2. If the post has no image yet (or an edit asked for a new one), Gemini draws it, it becomes a 1080×1080 JPEG and is stored in `content_media`, served by the Media Server.\n3. Sends the owner the `content_review` WhatsApp template: image + caption + **Approve / Edit / Skip** (button payloads carry the post id).\n\nFailures set the post to `preview_failed` with the error text.",
        "color": 5,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 300
      }
    }
